{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 3, "text": "5. “祭龙山节”", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 322, "w": 257, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "5. “祭龙山节”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 322, "w": 257, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 4, "text": "七月祭龙日（头龙、二龙均可），全寨出资买猪、羊各一头，大公鸡两只及酒、香纸、五", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 390, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "七月祭龙日（头龙、二龙均可），全寨出资买猪、羊各一头，大公鸡两只及酒、香纸、五", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 390, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 5, "text": "谷为祭品，在村旁古树下祭祀。先由寨老点几炷香、燃香化纸钱后，请布摩念经，再把猪", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 451, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "谷为祭品，在村旁古树下祭祀。先由寨老点几炷香、燃香化纸钱后，请布摩念经，再把猪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 451, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 6, "text": "羊拉来杀。在猪羊未断气时，用纸钱沾着鲜血贴于神树上；又将一对公鸡宰杀，礼仪同", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "羊拉来杀。在猪羊未断气时，用纸钱沾着鲜血贴于神树上；又将一对公鸡宰杀，礼仪同", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 7, "text": "前，称为“生祭”。然后，把猪、鸡整理干净，割猪尾插于猪嘴，与猪肝、猪心、整鸡煮熟后又", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 583, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "前，称为“生祭”。然后，把猪、鸡整理干净，割猪尾插于猪嘴，与猪肝、猪心、整鸡煮熟后又", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 583, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 8, "text": "祭，称“熟祭”。祭毕，全寨会餐一顿，剩下的肉分给大家带回家供祖。有的村寨还借此宣", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 644, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祭，称“熟祭”。祭毕，全寨会餐一顿，剩下的肉分给大家带回家供祖。有的村寨还借此宣", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 644, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 9, "text": "布保护古树，保护山林，爱护庄稼等乡规民约，用以促进社会治安。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 712, "w": 1150, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布保护古树，保护山林，爱护庄稼等乡规民约，用以促进社会治安。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 712, "w": 1150, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 10, "text": "6. “重阳节”", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 776, "w": 217, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "6. “重阳节”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 776, "w": 217, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 11, "text": "“重阳节”是同其他各民族共同过的节日，而且布依族广大地区过重阳节比较普遍。", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 841, "w": 1471, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“重阳节”是同其他各民族共同过的节日，而且布依族广大地区过重阳节比较普遍。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 841, "w": 1471, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 12, "text": "重阳节这天，家家户户打粑粑，庆贺重阳节（布依族叫“更七母”）。因为这个节日正是秋", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 901, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "重阳节这天，家家户户打粑粑，庆贺重阳节（布依族叫“更七母”）。因为这个节日正是秋", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 901, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 13, "text": "收结束，吃新米饭，打糯米粑过节，一是新米新味道，二是庆贺丰收。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 974, "w": 1166, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "收结束，吃新米饭，打糯米粑过节，一是新米新味道，二是庆贺丰收。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 974, "w": 1166, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 14, "text": "7.“清明节”", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1034, "w": 217, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "7.“清明节”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1034, "w": 217, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 15, "text": "与汉族一样，布依族在清明节也要上坟、挂青，一般而言，逝世不到三年的新坟，孝子", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1102, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与汉族一样，布依族在清明节也要上坟、挂青，一般而言，逝世不到三年的新坟，孝子", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1102, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 16, "text": "贤孙们要去扫墓，而对于祖坟则挂青即可。如果在清明节后没有人挂青，则是无后的孤", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1167, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "贤孙们要去扫墓，而对于祖坟则挂青即可。如果在清明节后没有人挂青，则是无后的孤", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1167, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 17, "text": "坟了。但望谟县桑郎、昂武等地，清明不扫墓，三月三才上坟，也吃粑粑；红水河一带吃糯", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1231, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "坟了。但望谟县桑郎、昂武等地，清明不扫墓，三月三才上坟，也吃粑粑；红水河一带吃糯", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1231, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 18, "text": "米饭讲究色道，如清明吃三色糯米饭，端午吃五色糯米饭。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1291, "w": 1009, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "米饭讲究色道，如清明吃三色糯米饭，端午吃五色糯米饭。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1291, "w": 1009, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 19, "text": "中秋节兴“偷”老瓜煮糯米饭吃。缺孩子的中青年妇女，别人可将老瓜用红布包好，", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1344, "w": 1468, "h": 72}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "中秋节兴“偷”老瓜煮糯米饭吃。缺孩子的中青年妇女，别人可将老瓜用红布包好，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1344, "w": 1468, "h": 72}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 20, "text": "送到她家去，一路放爆竹，主家请酒宵夜。被“偷”老瓜主人不能打骂“偷瓜人”，此是古代", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1420, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送到她家去，一路放爆竹，主家请酒宵夜。被“偷”老瓜主人不能打骂“偷瓜人”，此是古代", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1420, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 21, "text": "传下来的规矩。", "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 1492, "w": 270, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "传下来的规矩。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 1492, "w": 270, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 22, "text": "（二）生产性节日", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1557, "w": 297, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）生产性节日", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1557, "w": 297, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 23, "text": "生产性节日又称农事节日。它的最初形成，也是和农业生产中的祭祀活动有关。因", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1621, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生产性节日又称农事节日。它的最初形成，也是和农业生产中的祭祀活动有关。因", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1621, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 24, "text": "此，生产性节日也同样带有祭祀、纪念等意义。布依族自古就是一个以农业耕作为主的", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此，生产性节日也同样带有祭祀、纪念等意义。布依族自古就是一个以农业耕作为主的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1686, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 25, "text": "民族，在其节日文化的发展过程中，生产性节目的原始信仰成分逐渐减少，变为庆视丰", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1750, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民族，在其节日文化的发展过程中，生产性节目的原始信仰成分逐渐减少，变为庆视丰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1750, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 26, "text": "收、祈求丰年的活动，这一类节日占整个布依族节日数的三分之一左右。其中，最主要的", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1810, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "收、祈求丰年的活动，这一类节日占整个布依族节日数的三分之一左右。其中，最主要的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1810, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 27, "text": "为“尝新节”和“四月八”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1875, "w": 450, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "为“尝新节”和“四月八”。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1875, "w": 450, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 28, "text": "1. “尝新节”", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1939, "w": 213, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "1. “尝新节”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1939, "w": 213, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 29, "text": "“尝新节”又叫“新米节”或“吃新节”，是西南地区许多民族中流行的庆祝农业丰收", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 2004, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“尝新节”又叫“新米节”或“吃新节”，是西南地区许多民族中流行的庆祝农业丰收", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 2004, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 30, "text": "的节日。如阿昌、景颇、僳僳、普米、苗、侗、壮、瑤等民族都有“尝新节”。但日期各民族、", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2072, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "的节日。如阿昌、景颇、僳僳、普米、苗、侗、壮、瑤等民族都有“尝新节”。但日期各民族、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2072, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 31, "text": "各地不一，一般都在谷子成熟时举行。布依族所在地区，谷米成熟有先有后，所以“尝新", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2136, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "各地不一，一般都在谷子成熟时举行。布依族所在地区，谷米成熟有先有后，所以“尝新", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2136, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 32, "text": "节”也各有不同，没有一定的日期。一般谷子将成熟，大家共同约定一个日子，打粑粑、祭", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2201, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "节”也各有不同，没有一定的日期。一般谷子将成熟，大家共同约定一个日子，打粑粑、祭", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2201, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 256, "line_no": 33, "text": "祖。望谟、册享一带多从田里摘来一些将成熟的糯谷穗，放在锅内煮或蒸，晾干后，春去", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2269, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祖。望谟、册享一带多从田里摘来一些将成熟的糯谷穗，放在锅内煮或蒸，晾干后，春去", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2269, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
